Description: OrcaSlicer development build (parallel-installable with Flathub stable)
 OrcaSlicer is a 3D-printer slicer based on Bambu Studio / PrusaSlicer
 with additional features and improvements.
 .
 This package installs a self-contained development build to
 /opt/orcaslicer-dev/, with a launcher symlink at /usr/bin/orcaslicer-dev.
 .
 It is intended to coexist with the official stable Flathub install at
 com.orcaslicer.OrcaSlicer. Configuration is stored separately in
 ~/.config/OrcaSlicer/ (independent of the Flatpak's config directory).
